    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astroball</strong> is a physics based platformer set in space. Explore 31 levels full of different obstacles and paths, unlocking unique skins that alter the physics of your ball, on your way to collect all the gold medals!<br><strong><br>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based movement and interaction with the ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31 unique levels with 4 different themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple different objects that can help or hinder your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few steam achievements to strive for</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game progression through Bronze, Silver and Gold Medals.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astroball</strong> is a physics based platformer set in space. Explore 31 levels full of different obstacles and paths, unlocking unique skins that alter the physics of your ball, on your way to collect all the gold medals!<br><strong><br>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based movement and interaction with the ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31 unique levels with 4 different themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple different objects that can help or hinder your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few steam achievements to strive for</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game progression through Bronze, Silver and Gold Medals.</p></li></ul>",
